          {
            "path": "src/modules/labels/domain/label.ts",
            "purpose": "Pure product vocabulary: camelCase Label type, LabelNameSchema (trim, normalize, 1..64 cap), CreateLabelSchema, RenameLabelSchema, and canManageLabels(actor). Framework- and provider-independent; the schema library is a classified pure dependency. Shared by actions.ts and server.ts so name rules are declared once."
          },
          {
            "path": "src/modules/labels/server/labels-store.ts",
            "purpose": "server-only private adapter and the only file that knows Supabase or snake_case: LabelRowSchema, explicit LABEL_COLUMNS select list, row->Label mapping, one tested ilike escaping helper (backslash escaped first), explicit workspace_id/owner predicates on every query, and Postgres error mapping (23505 -> typed name-taken, zero-rows update -> typed not-found). Reports nothing."
