          {
            "path": "src/modules/labels/actions.ts",
            "purpose": "Top-level 'use server' mutation boundary with locally declared async functions createLabelAction and renameLabelAction. Parses FormData with domain schemas, establishes identity (treated as a public HTTP entrypoint), calls server.ts, returns serializable action state, and calls revalidatePath('/labels'). Reports an unexpected failure once."
