          {
            "topic": "Row versus product types",
            "choice": "LabelRowSchema, LABEL_COLUMNS, and row->Label mapping live only in server/labels-store.ts",
            "rationale": "Storage names and product names change for different reasons. Explicit column selection stops a migration from silently widening the payload, and mapping keeps snake_case out of forms, views, and the JSON contract."
